              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndũkatane, we Isilaeli, nũndũ wa mũyo, ta ngo sya andũ; nũndũ nĩwĩkĩte ũmalwaya, ũkĩmũtia Ngai waku; nĩwendete kwĩthooesyaa o kĩla kĩvũĩonĩ kya lĩu wa mbaa ngetha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
