              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noonie Isilaeli ailyĩ ta nzavivũ weũnĩ; noonie aaĩthe menyu o ta ĩkũyũ yambaa kwĩw’a mũkũyũnĩ ĩvinda ya kũsyaa kwaw’o kwa mbee: ĩndĩ maenda kwa Mbaali‐veoli, meenengane kwa kĩndũ kyu kĩ nthoni, na matw’ĩka kĩla kĩthatasya o ta kyu mendete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
